  m_text: 'This is one of the oldest artifacts from Egypt ever found, dating back
    to 3,000. It is a mixture of engravings and hieroglpyhs.


    It is  the oldest
    image of a unified Egypt with a single ruler over all of it, showing the ruler
    historians know as "Narmer". '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 756a8c9b083f04819b8b1c63c736172c, type: 2}
