      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Thanks so much for reading, I hope you learned a little and enjoyed the
    art. \n\nThanks to Christian Casey for the invaluable edits distinguishing hieroglyphs
    from tomb paintings.\n\nAs a note: I would love to do more books on Egypt, the
    Roman empire, and other less popular and known parts of history, like the feudal
    times of Japan, the pirate kings of Singapore, or the Islamic Golden Age.  \n\nYour
    support is appreciated, if you could leave a rating or a comment it really helps
    us move forward with this project.\n\n\n-Brian."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 756a8c9b083f04819b8b1c63c736172c, type: 2}
