  m_text: "Egyptian boat building techniques improved slowly over time. From the
    original fishing boats made of reeds lashed together, techniques continued to
    evolve. \n\nBy the end of the Old Kingdom, the Egyptians were producing beautiful
    funeral boats to carry mummies and large barges to transport goods.\n"
